@startuml
actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "WorkflowController" as C
participant "PlantCareFacade" as F
participant "PlantService" as S
participant "Builder + Factories" as P
database "H2 DB" as DB
User -> UI: Enter plant details / Save
UI -> C: POST /api/workflows/plants
C -> F: registerPlant(request)
F -> S: add(request)
S -> P: build plant + create tasks
P --> S: Plant + CareTasks
S -> DB: save plant and tasks
DB --> S: persisted data
S --> F: Plant
F --> C: Plant
C --> UI: 201 Created
UI --> User: Plant card and tasks
@enduml
